00:02:33,625 --> 00:02:38,515
what makes you move? what makes you breathe?

25
00:02:38,515 --> 00:02:42,760
What makes your tiny life worth living another day?

26
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:51,084
What makes you live?
What gives your little heart that bravery to face today? What keeps you alive?

27
